# Allowlist: no local .env, data, .runtime, archive, node_modules,
# paper2task_materials, deployment ZIPs, or unrelated files enter the build.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!src/**

# Also protect against private/runtime files accidentally added under src.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/data
**/.runtime
**/archive
**/paper2task_materials
**/*.test.js
**/*.log
